  storyText: "The Crate\n\nYou slip in, grab the crate, slip out. A Maelstrom turret swivels - then turns on its own gang. Mirage giggles.\n\nBack at the clinic, Doc Mori installs the ICE. The trace dies at 81%. \"Now,\" she says, \"you need to decide who to trust.\"\n\n1. Think about it."
